    "title": "Former Turks and Caicos Premier Michael Misick Sentenced in Corruption Case",
    "text": "• A court in the Turks and Caicos Islands has sentenced former Premier Michael Misick to just over four years in prison.\n• Misick was convicted in a corruption case.\n• He was arrested in December 2012 in Brazil after his application for political asylum was rejected.\n• Misick was accused of corruption, misusing public money, and profiting from the sale of government-owned land to developers.",
